            "detailed_description": "<strong>Ashes of Oahu is an open world, story driven shooter where you work with or against the surviving factions of a post apocalyptic Hawaii.</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Inspired by native Hawaiian stories, traditions, and beliefs but with a unique fictional twist that brings in ghosts, raiders, and gods<br></li><li>Four distinct factions to work for...or against!<br></li><li>Over 11,000 lines create a massive and engaging narrative<br></li><li>Choices truly matter and can lead to any one of over 100 different endings!<br></li><li>Guns take on new and amazing powers thanks to the Magical Weapon Mod System<br></li><li>Play your way by unlocking 50+ skills and abilities<br></li><li>25 sq/km of beautiful locations throughout Oahu, Hawaii<br></li><li>Craft items from Hawaiian resources you find throughout the island</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Ashes of Oahu is an open world, story driven shooter where you work with or against the surviving factions of a post apocalyptic Hawaii.</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Inspired by native Hawaiian stories, traditions, and beliefs but with a unique fictional twist that brings in ghosts, raiders, and gods<br></li><li>Four distinct factions to work for...or against!<br></li><li>Over 11,000 lines create a massive and engaging narrative<br></li><li>Choices truly matter and can lead to any one of over 100 different endings!<br></li><li>Guns take on new and amazing powers thanks to the Magical Weapon Mod System<br></li><li>Play your way by unlocking 50+ skills and abilities<br></li><li>25 sq/km of beautiful locations throughout Oahu, Hawaii<br></li><li>Craft items from Hawaiian resources you find throughout the island</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "An open world, post-apocalyptic RPG shooter where you tap into the power of the spirit world to liberate the Hawaiian island of Oahu from the army that occupies it.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
